/target
/server/receiver/target

# Terraform working state. terraform.tfvars names the tenancy and points at
# an API signing key; the state file additionally holds the rendered
# cloud-init and every resource OCID. Neither belongs in a git history.
# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored — it pins provider
# versions and is meant to be committed.
/server/terraform/.terraform/
/server/terraform/terraform.tfvars
/server/terraform/*.tfstate
/server/terraform/*.tfstate.*
/server/terraform/*.tfplan
# code-review reports (code-review, deep/repo review skills) stay local
CODE_REVIEW_*.md
DEEP_CODE_REVIEW_*.md
REPO_CODE_REVIEW_*.md
/docs/
# local release-signing material — the secret key must never be committed
/signing/
factory/CHECKPOINT.md
